# OpenEdit colour kind: Lua. MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Dalsin Limited.
name      Lua
files     #?.lua
firstline #!#?lua#?
case      on
block     --[[ ]]
comment   --
strings   "'
escape    \
numbers   on
keywords  and break do else elseif end false for function goto if in local nil not or
keywords  repeat return then true until while
commands  assert error ipairs next pairs pcall print rawget rawset require select setmetatable
commands  getmetatable tonumber tostring type unpack string table math io os
